{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/83998047b35617dc54b9f133bc0bb887.poster.avif?t=1756925009\" width=780 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/83998047b35617dc54b9f133bc0bb887.webm?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/83998047b35617dc54b9f133bc0bb887.mp4?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last train home. Or so you thought. Now, the rattling of the wheels is the only rhythm in an endless darkness, and each station that flickers in the gloom seems stranger than the last. Trapped on an endless journey through a forgotten subway line, you have only the fragments of your memories and the growing dread of not being alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/6ec5e8772b8267e87b14857b15e58bd0.poster.avif?t=1756925009\" width=464 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/6ec5e8772b8267e87b14857b15e58bd0.webm?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/6ec5e8772b8267e87b14857b15e58bd0.mp4?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultima Statio is a roguelike deckbuilder where every card is a recovered memory, a desperate tactic, or a manifestation of your fear. Create powerful synergies, upgrade your skills, and adapt your deck to face the terrifying entities that lurk in the tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NAVIGATE A NIGHTMARE MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/3e410260f77ff6fe61219cac1717ed4a.poster.avif?t=1756925009\" width=744 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/3e410260f77ff6fe61219cac1717ed4a.webm?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/3e410260f77ff6fe61219cac1717ed4a.mp4?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is unique. Choose your path through a procedurally generated map, but be warned: every stop is a choice. Will you risk combat for a valuable reward? Explore a mysterious event that could help or harm you? Or seek a moment of respite in the unlikely haven of a merchant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HORROR IS NOT WHAT YOU SEE, BUT WHAT YOU IMAGINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a minimalist and abstract art style, Ultima Statio focuses on psychological horror. The threats are not explicit monsters, but representations of anxiety and fear. An oppressive atmosphere, mysterious narrative, and an immersive sound design will plunge you into a world where your own mind is your worst enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat:</strong> Easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over [Number] Cards &amp; Items:</strong> Discover countless combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemies &amp; Bosses:</strong> Face personified fears with challenging AI patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong> With random maps, events, and rewards, no two runs are the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Do you dare to discover what awaits at the Ultima Statio? Add the game to your Wishlist and follow its development.</u></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958490?t=1756925009","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/27a3a551b51efed6b542e4732c62b3b840ecef1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756925009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/c4dcd23c735c2475af97d1705f79bbec2861c1a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756925009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/c4dcd23c735c2475af97d1705f79bbec2861c1a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756925009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/83998047b35617dc54b9f133bc0bb887.poster.avif?t=1756925009\" width=780 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/83998047b35617dc54b9f133bc0bb887.webm?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/83998047b35617dc54b9f133bc0bb887.mp4?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last train home. Or so you thought. Now, the rattling of the wheels is the only rhythm in an endless darkness, and each station that flickers in the gloom seems stranger than the last. Trapped on an endless journey through a forgotten subway line, you have only the fragments of your memories and the growing dread of not being alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/6ec5e8772b8267e87b14857b15e58bd0.poster.avif?t=1756925009\" width=464 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/6ec5e8772b8267e87b14857b15e58bd0.webm?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/6ec5e8772b8267e87b14857b15e58bd0.mp4?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultima Statio is a roguelike deckbuilder where every card is a recovered memory, a desperate tactic, or a manifestation of your fear. Create powerful synergies, upgrade your skills, and adapt your deck to face the terrifying entities that lurk in the tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NAVIGATE A NIGHTMARE MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/3e410260f77ff6fe61219cac1717ed4a.poster.avif?t=1756925009\" width=744 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/3e410260f77ff6fe61219cac1717ed4a.webm?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958490/extras/3e410260f77ff6fe61219cac1717ed4a.mp4?t=1756925009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is unique. Choose your path through a procedurally generated map, but be warned: every stop is a choice. Will you risk combat for a valuable reward? Explore a mysterious event that could help or harm you? Or seek a moment of respite in the unlikely haven of a merchant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HORROR IS NOT WHAT YOU SEE, BUT WHAT YOU IMAGINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a minimalist and abstract art style, Ultima Statio focuses on psychological horror. The threats are not explicit monsters, but representations of anxiety and fear. An oppressive atmosphere, mysterious narrative, and an immersive sound design will plunge you into a world where your own mind is your worst enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat:</strong> Easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over [Number] Cards &amp; Items:</strong> Discover countless combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemies &amp; Bosses:</strong> Face personified fears with challenging AI patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong> With random maps, events, and rewards, no two runs are the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Do you dare to discover what awaits at the Ultima Statio? Add the game to your Wishlist and follow its development.</u></strong></p>","developers":["Wayfarer's Lamp Games"],"genres":[{"description":